=== a value of the wrong type or out of range in a profile names the setting and the value
--- wrong type
Code: 27. Cannot parse input: expected 'eof' before: 'abc': while setting 'max_threads' to value 'abc': while parsing profile 'default' in users configuration file: while loading configuration. (CANNOT_PARSE_INPUT_ASSERTION_FAILED)
--- out of range
Code: 72. Unsigned type must not contain '-' symbol: while setting 'max_threads' to value '-1': while parsing profile 'default' in users configuration file: while loading configuration. (CANNOT_PARSE_NUMBER)

=== a malformed URI in a profile names the setting, and a password in the value is masked
--- malformed URI
Code: 36. Cannot parse URI: Bad URI syntax: unterminated IPv6 address: while setting 'format_avro_schema_registry_url' to value 'http://[': while parsing profile 'default' in users configuration file: while loading configuration. (BAD_ARGUMENTS)
--- malformed URI with a password
Code: 36. Cannot parse URI: Bad URI syntax: unterminated IPv6 address: while setting 'format_avro_schema_registry_url' to value 'http://user:[HIDDEN]@[': while parsing profile 'default' in users configuration file: while loading configuration. (BAD_ARGUMENTS)
password echoed: 0

=== a malformed URI in a constraint is reported the same way
--- constraint with a password
Code: 36. Cannot parse URI: Bad URI syntax: unterminated IPv6 address: while setting 'format_avro_schema_registry_url' to value 'http://user:[HIDDEN]@[': while parsing profile 'default' in users configuration file: while loading configuration. (BAD_ARGUMENTS)
password echoed: 0

=== a profile with a fine value still works
--- fine value
1
